    "rich_text_3hNNBB": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_dQtMJt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Multi-Day Freedom: Finding the Best 20000mAh Power Bank for Your Travels",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_tBPf9i": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Uninterrupted power for your longest journeys. RORRY’s 20,000mAh power banks provide multi-day battery life for your entire tech ecosystem—including laptops, phones, and wearables—wrapped in an ultra-slim, lightweight chassis that redefines high-capacity charging with elegance.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_kMa6xy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Ultimate Security for Long-Haul Trips",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_N8dXxh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When preparing for a long business trip or a weekend getaway, a smaller battery just won't cut it. You need a <strong>portable power bank 20000mah</strong> that can handle multiple devices for days without needing a wall outlet. However, most high-capacity chargers are bulky, masculine, and unpleasant to carry.<br/><br/>At RORRY, we’ve challenged this standard with the <strong>RORRY CharmGo D2-20000mAh (30W)</strong>. We've managed to pack a massive 20,000mAh cell into a sleek, soft-touch casing with our signature keychain ring, making it the <strong>best 20000mah power bank</strong> for keeping your travel bag light and your iPhone, Apple Watch, and AirPods fully charged throughout your journey.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_ntNqjr": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Charging Your Laptop on the Go",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_Kte9W9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For the modern professional or digital nomad, keeping your laptop alive is a priority. If you need a reliable <strong>20000mah power bank for laptop</strong> use, our high-power lineup is built to deliver.<br/><br/>While the CharmGo D2 offers a fast 30W output, perfect for a MacBook Air or iPad, those carrying a power-hungry MacBook Pro can upgrade to our <a href=\"/products/rorry-h3-25000mah-65w-laptop-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY H3 25000mAh Laptop Power Bank 65W\"><strong>H3 25000mAh 65W Laptop Charger</strong></a> for maximum speed. Transitioning from a crowded airport gate to a cozy café has never been easier when you have a lightweight <a href=\"/collections/power-banks\" title=\"Power Banks\"><strong>power bank</strong></a> 20000mah that keeps your work uninterrupted.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_xmfHbT": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Sleek Design Meets Peace of Mind",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_Fjjcig": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our commitment to \"Power in Style\" means even our largest batteries are designed to look and feel premium. Every <strong>power bank of 20000mah</strong> we create features a sophisticated matte finish and compact dimensions that won't clutter your handbag.<br/><br/>If you prefer a magnetic option for shorter daily commutes, we recommend checking out our ultra-slim MagSafe 10000mAh collection or our <a href=\"/collections/t1-series-keychain-power-bank\" title=\"T1 Series Keychain Power Bank\"><strong>T1 keychain series</strong></a>. But when you're heading off the grid, RORRY’s 20K series is the only portable battery charger 20000mah you'll need.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
